1
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,430
Boss,

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,430
Longqing has transferred
all the black money

3
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,120
to an offshore shell company,

4
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:18,990
planning to launder it
by acquiring the Wen Group.

5
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,390
Good.

6
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,990
Now that they intend to launder money,

7
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,720
we'll make them invest it all
in Wen Group.

8
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:32,920
Then,

9
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,730
they will lose everything.

10
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:38,900
You mean...

11
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,000
Wen Jianan,

12
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,180
it's time for us to work together.

13
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:55,980
These documents can prove

14
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:58,150
that the new drug is connected

15
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,380
to the fugitive He Mu.

16
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:00,430
So,

17
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:03,330
this drug originated from the patent

18
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,160
that He Mu stole from your mother,
Jiang Yuqing?

19
00:01:06,170 --> 00:01:06,860
Yes.

20
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:10,300
We aren’t only here to hand
over evidence today.

21
00:01:11,510 --> 00:01:13,920
He Mu owes me more than just a legal debt.

22
00:01:14,890 --> 00:01:18,170
We request to join you
in hunting down He Mu.

23
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:22,590
Hunting down serious fugitives is
the police's job.

24
00:01:22,590 --> 00:01:24,070
I know how you feel.

25
00:01:24,870 --> 00:01:27,000
I also want to thank Miss Wen,

26
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:28,840
who collected all kinds of evidence

27
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,320
after the car accident.

28
00:01:30,430 --> 00:01:33,120
That's how we were able to
get He Mu sentenced severely.

29
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:35,840
I also want to thank you, Mr. Jiang.

30
00:01:35,870 --> 00:01:37,950
Under Representative Yin's leadership,
you cooperated with the police

31
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:40,950
to thoroughly investigate
the Qin Shan bribery case

32
00:01:42,430 --> 00:01:43,950
and stopped the expansion of Qin Shan

33
00:01:43,950 --> 00:01:45,680
and the evil forces behind him.

34
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,120
But...

35
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,650
Police Commissioner Chen.

36
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:54,200
Mr. Yin, why are you here?

37
00:01:54,670 --> 00:01:56,479
This is the authorization document.

38
00:01:56,479 --> 00:01:58,560
This case will be handled specially,

39
00:01:59,150 --> 00:02:01,150
and I will personally supervise it.

40
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,200
Okay.

41
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:17,450
Your evidence can only prove

42
00:02:17,630 --> 00:02:20,190
that He Mu is connected
to the drug ingredient,

43
00:02:20,190 --> 00:02:21,360
but it can't prove

44
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:24,560
that he is directly linked to

45
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:27,690
the Wen Group’s anti-aging
beauty capsule scandal.

46
00:02:27,930 --> 00:02:29,010
What do you mean?

47
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:31,520
To arrest him,

48
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:34,540
you have to complete
the chain of evidence.

49
00:02:37,150 --> 00:02:39,210
Why are you getting involved in this?

50
00:02:41,030 --> 00:02:42,810
[Dearest Episode 22]

51
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,430
Because my target

52
00:02:49,710 --> 00:02:51,750
has never been He Mu.

53
00:02:54,750 --> 00:02:55,840
Who is that?

54
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,360
Longqing.

55
00:02:58,710 --> 00:03:01,360
The Longqing Gang used to
be the biggest gang in Xinggang,

56
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,630
committing all kinds of crimes.

57
00:03:02,630 --> 00:03:04,080
Now they are making a comeback,

58
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,870
trying to launder their money
through He Mu

59
00:03:06,870 --> 00:03:07,860
and go legitimate again.

60
00:03:07,860 --> 00:03:09,260
I won't let them succeed.

61
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:14,960
Is that why you got close to me?

62
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,610
I got close to you

63
00:03:21,870 --> 00:03:23,750
because you are interesting.

64
00:03:24,630 --> 00:03:26,520
I want to help you, Wen Jianan.

65
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,190
Help me?

66
00:03:36,710 --> 00:03:37,800
Yin Mingzhu,

67
00:03:38,220 --> 00:03:40,570
don't you think that as a fan,

68
00:03:41,150 --> 00:03:44,150
what you've done for me
is a bit too crazy

69
00:03:44,590 --> 00:03:45,800
and too much?

70
00:03:48,910 --> 00:03:49,750
Crazy?

71
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:54,000
Telling a crazy woman that she is crazy

72
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,520
can only give her the idea

73
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,180
that she can act even crazier.

74
00:03:58,030 --> 00:03:58,960
And

75
00:03:59,630 --> 00:04:01,430
it will make her very unhappy.

76
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:09,910
Did I make you unhappy?

77
00:04:15,710 --> 00:04:16,390
Tell me.

78
00:04:17,630 --> 00:04:18,760
What are your terms?

79
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:24,410
Longqing is indeed a big fish.

80
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:27,430
Catching him will also be
an achievement for me.

81
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,800
It's a win-win for us.

82
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,310
What do you plan to do?

83
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:38,680
I want you to lure Longqing into the trap

84
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:42,120
and make him invest all his black money
into Wen Group.

85
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:45,800
You want us to play along with you,

86
00:04:45,990 --> 00:04:48,100
convincing him the acquisition is secure,

87
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:50,630
and then pull the ladder away
at the last step.

88
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:53,070
Once his money is
transferred domestically,

89
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:54,870
you can use your authority

90
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,310
to freeze his assets.

91
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,350
Smart girl.

92
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,120
You have the Wen Group

93
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:03,390
and Cloudsea's intelligence network.

94
00:05:03,390 --> 00:05:04,190
And I

95
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:07,960
can bring them to justice
once and for all.

96
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:36,540
Hello?

97
00:05:36,570 --> 00:05:38,570
I still have some capsules in stock.

98
00:05:38,650 --> 00:05:39,200
Do you want them?

99
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:39,710
Yes.

100
00:05:40,930 --> 00:05:41,990
I'll pay any price.

101
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:52,920
Kelly.

102
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,270
Kelly.

103
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:58,950
Kelly.

104
00:06:01,430 --> 00:06:02,630
I'm here to buy drugs.

105
00:06:02,740 --> 00:06:04,100
I brought a lot of money.

106
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:07,300
It's enough to buy your drugs.

107
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:09,750
Kelly.

108
00:06:12,190 --> 00:06:13,000
Xin,

109
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:15,360
long time no see.

110
00:06:18,670 --> 00:06:20,460
He Mu, you'd be in…

111
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,800
In prison?

112
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:23,680
You know,

113
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,240
no place can hold me.

114
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:27,830
Thanks to you,

115
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:30,310
I'll be taking over the Wen Group soon.

116
00:06:33,060 --> 00:06:36,170
So, this was all your scheme.

117
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,990
Kelly works for you.

118
00:06:38,430 --> 00:06:40,120
You told her to get close to me.

119
00:06:41,350 --> 00:06:41,950
Yes.

120
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:44,330
After all these years,

121
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,680
you're still the most naive,

122
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:49,850
and the easiest to fool.

123
00:06:54,710 --> 00:06:55,840
You've lost weight,

124
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:57,680
and look haggard.

125
00:06:58,280 --> 00:07:00,430
Drug withdrawal must be tough.

126
00:07:08,260 --> 00:07:09,140
Want some?

127
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:12,380
I have all the anti-aging capsules here.

128
00:07:13,610 --> 00:07:15,610
As long as you cooperate with me,

129
00:07:15,970 --> 00:07:16,700
I can give you

130
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:19,840
as much as you want.

131
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,390
Wen Xin.

132
00:07:53,730 --> 00:07:54,620
Where is she?

133
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,270
Just this morning,

134
00:08:26,430 --> 00:08:28,680
three more shareholders
withdrew their capital.

135
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,630
Recently, news everywhere
has been frequently reporting incidents of

136
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:32,440
side effects from the anti-aging capsules.

137
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,100
We've suffered heavy losses.

138
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:35,870
Ever since
the anti-aging capsule incident,

139
00:08:35,870 --> 00:08:38,440
everyone has been distancing themselves
from the Wen Group.

140
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,840
Now even the bank is pressing us

141
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,770
for the loan of the Xingji theme park.

142
00:08:41,770 --> 00:08:44,130
If we can't find a new capital injection,

143
00:08:44,450 --> 00:08:46,780
Wen Group's cash flow won't last a month.

144
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:50,000
I'll have Hao check tomorrow

145
00:08:50,350 --> 00:08:51,750
and transfer the liquid funds

146
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:53,550
from Cloudsea's account to you.

147
00:08:53,810 --> 00:08:55,070
I can't use your money.

148
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,200
If we put all our money

149
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,750
in one place,

150
00:08:57,780 --> 00:08:59,140
that's a real gamble.

151
00:09:01,630 --> 00:09:03,090
Then what do you want to do?

152
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:07,200
We have to find someone

153
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,720
with enough resources,

154
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:11,680
willing to take over
at this critical moment.

155
00:09:21,070 --> 00:09:22,190
I can find someone.

156
00:09:23,850 --> 00:09:25,980
I know someone who can inject capital.

157
00:09:34,470 --> 00:09:37,600
I've had Hao keeping an eye on Wen Xin
these past few days.

158
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:40,430
You don't need to worry
too much about her safety.

159
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:41,910
Also, I found out

160
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:45,500
that the capital behind Wen Xin
might be Longqing.

161
00:09:50,990 --> 00:09:54,830
He Mu controlled Wen Xin
with drug capsules,

162
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:57,570
and made her recommend investors to you.

163
00:09:57,570 --> 00:09:59,100
Having her people involved

164
00:09:59,110 --> 00:10:01,800
would also make it easier
for you to accept her.

165
00:10:07,850 --> 00:10:09,130
She actually...

166
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:20,800
We should have eliminated
He Mu completely back then.

167
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,080
Otherwise,

168
00:10:24,530 --> 00:10:26,660
she wouldn't have to suffer like this.

169
00:10:43,730 --> 00:10:45,190
After everything is over,

170
00:10:46,930 --> 00:10:48,410
we'll send Wen Xin to rehab

171
00:10:49,800 --> 00:10:51,130
and help her start over,

172
00:10:52,900 --> 00:10:53,690
okay?
